title The mask a repair spares, read once for the whole ladder
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, Standfast on reds first, council rota one row, send.
think Standfast ran before any code moved. crux/REDS.md carries 128 rows and every one of them closes -- %127 and %128 both wear CLOSED notes, and tools/gen/season/reds_ledger_monotone_witness.rish prints verdict=ok with headline_total=128, headline_remainder=108, headline_span=128, disagreements=0. The line was clear, so the constructive queue opened.
think The running thread came off the newest three logs. Three laps in a row recommended bearing_published as the next head that widens nothing, and the carry witness's own printed queue said the same. The head was chosen by two independent records agreeing rather than by one being trusted.
think The fold was verified before it was taken rather than after. Hashing the body of bearing_published in each of the thirty-nine rungs returned one hash thirty-nine times, so no rung carried its own variant -- unlike the deem, owe, avow, and meet rungs of earlier laps, where the rung's own subject was the family's subject. Then all five symbols the body reaches -- max_queue_len, max_note_path_len, note_path, plan_name, phase_bit -- were checked for a leading pub in every one of the thirty-nine, and all five were already public everywhere.
think The lift itself moved the twenty-line body into caravan/ladder_checks.rye as pub fn bearing_published(comptime rung: type, io: std.Io, held: u32) u32, with each of the five reached symbols qualified through the type parameter, and replaced each rung's body with a three-line stub returning ladder_checks.bearing_published(@This(), io, held). Every doc comment stayed above its stub, since the doc describes what the rung publishes rather than how the body reads it.
obs Prediction met measurement to the digit for the seventh lap running. The realized fall is (identical_copies - 1) x (body_lines - stub_lines) and a stub is the signature plus two lines, so 38 x (20 - 3) = 646. Carry fell 77,617 to 76,971 -- a fall of 646. Delegates rose 2,764 to 2,803, exactly the thirty-nine stubs, which is how a reader tells a fold from a cost moved somewhere cheaper to count. Bodies 18,160 to 18,161 and distinct 7,956 to 7,957 -- the one published body the fold added.
obs Lindy-first chose 646 over 720 for the third lap running, and the reason keeps holding. renew_path returns about 720 and ask_path about 660, and both stand private in all thirty-one rungs, so either would open a seam across thirty-one declarations before it paid. A fall taken without widening stays cheap on the long return.
obs The queue's third place turned out to hide a wider seam than its number showed. choose_pass returns 630 and is public in all forty-three rungs, which reads as a clean fold until the body is opened -- it reaches waits, door_admits, and may_pass, and all three stand private. It would open three declarations rather than one. The witness prose now says so, since the visibility of a family's own name says nothing about the visibility of what its body reaches.
obs A shape surfaced worth its own round. Four families now read identically -- bearing_published, lost_published, appraisal_published, recant_published each open a glyph note, walk it against the held count, and fold it to a phase mask, differing only in the note suffix and the glyph. Three of the four already sit in ladder_checks or are queued for it, so a later round may fold all four into one body taking suffix and glyph as comptime parameters -- the same merge already booked for hand_path and tell_path.
obs Council rota, Earth and Mercury -- the concrete. The one-clock law priced why a stamp names better than a count: later is always larger, and a name that carries when needs no convention to read. Two Rooms held the register honest -- every number in this lap came off a meter, so it enters the checkable room, and the four-family merge is named as a shape a later round may take rather than as work already done. The marked value named the deeper pattern of the whole arc: a comptime rung parameter is a type-mark travelling with the value, and the thirty-nine stubs are each a value wearing its own name at the seam.
