recommend keep-going appraisal_published at thirty-eight rungs by twenty lines -- 629 by realized fall, one identical body in every rung, and the same five symbols already public throughout, so it is the head that widens nothing. renew_path (720) and ask_path (660) return more and each widens thirty-one declarations; choose_pass (630) is public in forty-three yet reaches three private neighbors, so it opens three. After it, recant_published at 612 closes the glyph-note family and makes the four-way merge a single readable round.
